where \(A_*\) converges to a positive constant (\(2(V_{*,zz}(0,0))^3 k_*'(0)^2\)). \end{lemma}

\begin{lemma}[Moments on moving boxes]\label{bud:box-moments}
Uniformly inside the buffer and for these averages, for every fixed
